      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In 26 patients endoscopic-radiologic pancreography routinely performed caused severe pain with certain origin from pancreatic glan. Pain could be stopped immediately and with constant effect by lingual application of nitroglycerine. According to these informations we suppose that pancreatic pain is started by vascular reactions and ischemia. The good effect of nitroglycerine is worth a control in patients with common acute pancreatitis."},
